=== parameters ===
P4 WEAK panel subsample n_assets=50; HORIZON=5; N_FOLDS=5; EMBARGO=5
features: mom_1/5/10/20, vol_5/20, rank_mom20 — built from returns ≤ t; label uses t+1..t+h
labels: forward sum; AFML ch.3 triple-barrier (pt=sl=2%, max_h=5); meta-label vs mom_20 side
cite: López de Prado, Advances in Financial Machine Learning (Wiley) ch.3 labels, ch.7 purged CV
look-ahead: features end at t; TB/meta inspect only future path for y; purge removes label-span overlap
eval: RankIC (NOT accuracy); shared P2/P4 cost model deferred to lab 02 for portfolios
MU_WEAK=0.001 panel (750, 50)
rows=36300 features=['mom_1', 'mom_5', 'mom_10', 'mom_20', 'vol_20', 'vol_5', 'rank_mom20']

=== label construction look-ahead audit ===
fwd_ret[t] = sum(rets[t+1..t+h]) — no feature uses rets after t
TB: walk path from t+1; vertical at h; pt/sl=0.02 — y uses future returns only
meta_y: 1 iff sign(mom_20[t]) agrees with tb_side[t] — primary side from feature at t only
tb_side value counts:
tb_side
-1.0    18623
 1.0    17677
meta_y mean (hit rate)=0.515

=== LEAK demos vs clean handling ===
LEAK shuffle_split RankIC=0.0615  (FORBIDDEN on time series)
LEAK global_scaler RankIC=0.0095
CLEAN train_only_scaler RankIC=0.0095
LEAK unpurged_shuffled_KFold RankIC=0.0654
CLEAN purged_KFold+embargo RankIC=-0.0076
teach: failures are usually in the pipeline — shuffle / global scale / unpurged CV inflate IC

=== walk-forward (expanding, train-only scaler) ===
walk_forward RankIC=0.0145

=== OVERFIT TRAP: deep GBM + many noise features ===
overfit_trap train_RankIC=0.4001 OOS_RankIC=0.0098
overfit_trap train_mean_daily_CS_IC=0.3445 OOS_mean_daily_CS_IC=0.0211
teach: high train IC + noise features + deep tree ≠ OOS edge; record trial count
